{"id":"n72451-2-7","stage":4,"title":"유동 · 流动","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72451-2-7-1","ko":"여기가 장사가 그렇게 잘된다면서요?","zh":"听说这里的生意这么好是吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기가","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기가","audio":"/audio/3ee44a24dbb231646aee.mp3"}},{"text":"장사가","meaning":"生意，经商","explanation":"장사：生意，经商；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장사","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71699","senseId":"1","lemma":"장사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장사가","audio":"/audio/4931b0ea22819db2a3b1.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"잘된다면서요?","meaning":"好，顺利","explanation":"잘되다：好，顺利；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的内容，连接后文的评论、确认或对照。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘된다면서요","audio":"/audio/c85bc87677ab13521c49.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"b5b81ac6a045174c","term":"장사","zh":"生意，经商","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3","entryId":"71699","definition":"为获取利益而买卖东西；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["장사"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"好，顺利","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"某事情或现象的结果好。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1e6517c9d6ebdb27d96e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72451-2-7-2","ko":"네. 근처에 지하철역과 버스 정류장이 있어 유동 인구가 많거든요.","zh":"是的。因为附近有地铁站和公交站，所以人流量很大。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"근처에","meaning":"附近，近处","explanation":"근처：附近，近处；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"근처","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62061","senseId":"1","lemma":"근처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"근처에","audio":"/audio/fd4c3e06470f8b90c75b.mp3"}},{"text":"지하철역과","meaning":"地铁站","explanation":"지하철역：地铁站；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"지하철역","audio":"/audio/64860555fc86a9fbcb01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77822","senseId":"1","lemma":"지하철역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지하철역과","audio":"/audio/02aca8f395ccd97c3b3c.mp3"}},{"text":"버스","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}},{"text":"정류장이","meaning":"车站","explanation":"정류장：车站；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정류장","audio":"/audio/888da7692e098e28c0f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62519","senseId":"1","lemma":"정류장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정류장이","audio":"/audio/50ab3c98b301b0bb9a53.mp3"}},{"text":"있어","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}},{"text":"유동","meaning":"流动","explanation":"유동：流动","readings":[{"term":"유동","audio":"/audio/536860fb00d6e5beb1ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72451","senseId":"2","lemma":"유동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유동","audio":"/audio/536860fb00d6e5beb1ac.mp3"}},{"text":"인구가","meaning":"人口","explanation":"인구：人口；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인구","audio":"/audio/e828a2c8cae28d1dd018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62590","senseId":"1","lemma":"인구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인구가","audio":"/audio/9051082d642b54da951a.mp3"}},{"text":"많거든요.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；거든요：礼貌地补充理由或背景。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많거든요","audio":"/audio/13b53da1a8abd42cb782.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"e44b07ac25b977cc","term":"근처","zh":"附近，近处","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3","entryId":"62061","definition":"以某场所、东西或人为中心，较近的地方。","pronunciation":["근ː처"]},{"id":"64860555fc86a9fb","term":"지하철역","zh":"地铁站","audio":"/audio/64860555fc86a9fbcb01.mp3","entryId":"77822","definition":"乘坐或下地铁的地方。","pronunciation":["지하철력"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"888da7692e098e28","term":"정류장","zh":"车站","audio":"/audio/888da7692e098e28c0f2.mp3","entryId":"62519","definition":"为让人上下车，汽车或出租车等停车的地方。","pronunciation":["정뉴장"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"536860fb00d6e5be","term":"유동","zh":"流动","audio":"/audio/536860fb00d6e5beb1ac.mp3","entryId":"72451","definition":"持续运动或变化。","pronunciation":["유동"]},{"id":"e828a2c8cae28d1d","term":"인구","zh":"人口","audio":"/audio/e828a2c8cae28d1dd018.mp3","entryId":"62590","definition":"生活在一定区域内的人数。","pronunciation":["인구"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/74b3b5830a98cbe516bc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.074,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72451","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":146,"sequenceScore":2.9007,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的。因为附近有地铁站和公交站，所以人流量很大。","这杯果汁的果汁浓度太低了。","听说这里的生意这么好是吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是的。因为附近有地铁站和公交站，所以人流量很大。","听说这里的生意这么好是吗？","这杯果汁的果汁浓度太低了。"],"answer":0}]}
